@startuml LMS_Transform_Analysis
title Transform Analysis: DFD to Structure Chart

skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #222222
  RoundCorner 6
}
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

package "Afferent Branch (Input)" {
  rectangle "Enter Issue Data\n(Patron ID & Accession No.)" as INP1 #E3F2FD
  rectangle "Validate Input\n(Format & Sanitization)" as INP2 #E3F2FD
  rectangle "Fetch Entity Profiles\n(Patron & Copy Records)" as INP3 #E3F2FD
}

package "Transform Center" {
  rectangle "TRANSFORM CENTER\nVerify Business Rules\n\n• Patron Active Status\n• Role Quota Check\n• Fine Balance Check\n• Copy Availability\n• Calculate Due Date" as TC #FFF9C4
}

package "Efferent Branch (Output)" {
  rectangle "Commit Atomic Loan\n(Create Transaction & Mark Issued)" as OUT1 #E8F5E9
  rectangle "Format Receipt\n(Due Card & Confirmation)" as OUT2 #E8F5E9
  rectangle "Render / Print Receipt\n(Display to Librarian)" as OUT3 #E8F5E9
}

INP1 -right-> INP2 : Raw Input
INP2 -right-> INP3 : Cleaned IDs
INP3 -right-> TC : Validated Entities

TC -right-> OUT1 : Approved Loan Terms
OUT1 -right-> OUT2 : Committed Record
OUT2 -right-> OUT3 : Formatted Receipt

note bottom of TC
  **Transform Analysis:**
  Identifies Afferent Boundary (input ceases)
  and Efferent Boundary (output begins).
  Central operations form top-level modules.
end note

@enduml
